# dwarves-kit / SDD operating-layer artifacts are internal process, not part of
# the published plugin. Kept out of this public repo (they live in a private
# development repo). A `kit:adopt` run re-creates them locally; do not commit.
AGENTS.md
WORKFLOW.md
.kit.toml
docs/*
# ... except the proof-of-done records: the ship-gate requires them tracked,
# and they are test/verification records with nothing private in them.
# (docs/* not docs/: git cannot re-include below an excluded DIRECTORY.)
!docs/verification/
.claude/

# local scratch
*.log
.DS_Store
